      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>ResultsInformationThereAreNegativeBalances</name>
        <id>218</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>After the formation of the documents there were periods at the end of which &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>on some goods&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> there were unrecovered demands in receiving company. It is possible that the selected senders do not have enough goods in these periods to cover demands.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>پس از ایجاد اسناد، دوره‌هایی وجود داشت که در پایان آن‌ها &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>برای برخی کالاها&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> نیازهای تأمین‌نشده در شرکت دریافت‌کننده وجود داشت. ممکن است فرستندگان انتخاب‌شده در این دوره‌ها کالای کافی برای پوشش نیازها نداشته باشند.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>После формирования документов остались периоды, на конец которых по &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>некоторым товарам&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> остались не покрытые потребности в организации-получателе. Возможно у выбранных отправителей не достаточно товаров в этих периодах для покрытия потребностей.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>Belgelerin oluşturulmasından sonra, &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>doğrultusunda bazı ürünlerin&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> alıcı iş yerinde hala karşılanmamış ihtiyaçların olduğu dönemler kalmıştır. Seçilen göndericilerin bu dönemlerde ihtiyaçları karşılayacak kadar ürünü olmayabilir.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>Sau khi lập chứng từ, còn lại các kỳ mà vào cuối các kỳ đó &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>còn lại những nhu cầu về một số hàng hóa chưa được đáp ứng&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> trong doanh nghiệp nhận. Có thể là những nơi gửi hàng đã chọn không đủ hàng trong các kỳ này để đáp ứng nhu cầu.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>After the formation of the documents there were periods at the end of which &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>on some goods&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> there were unrecovered demands in receiving company. It is possible that the selected senders do not have enough goods in these periods to cover demands.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle -16>After the formation of the documents there were periods at the end of which &lt;/>&lt;link Report>&lt;colorstyle 0:757b547b-b79c-459a-a64a-eef19a09a38f>on some goods&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle -16> there were unrecovered demands in receiving company. It is possible that the selected senders do not have enough goods in these periods to cover demands.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
