      <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
        <name>ResultsInformationNoNegativeBalances</name>
        <id>221</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>Generated documents fully covered demands of receiving company.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>اسناد ایجادشده نیازهای شرکت دریافت‌کننده را به‌طور کامل پوشش دادند.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>I documenti generati hanno coperto completamente i fabbisogni dell'organizzazione-destinatario.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>Utworzone dokumenty całkowicie pokryły zapotrzebowanie firm odbiorcy.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>Сформированные документы полностью покрыли потребности организации-получателя.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>Oluşturulan belgeler, alıcı iş yerinin ihtiyaçlarını tam olarak karşıladı.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>&lt;colorstyle 0:7e11b0d9-b5aa-46ea-ad72-a871dfa7204d>Các chứng từ đã tạo ra đáp ứng đầy đủ nhu cầu của doanh nghiệp nhận.&lt;/></value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
